	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Literas, quas ad me misisti <placeName ref="l587">Tiguro</placeName>, ornatissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>porro transmittendas ad <persName ref="p380">Ioannem Bircmannum</persName> scriptas 20. <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>augusti, receptas in sequenti die <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiam</placeName> ad eundem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>perferri curavi, tardius autem ad me, nempe 8. septembris <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>allate sunt.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Circiter eosdem dies unas ad magnificentiam tuam dedi, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in quibus, quantum per febriles infestationes licuit, et de rebus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l749">Saxonicis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l830">Anglicis</placeName> cognita tibi communicavi, postea quoque <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>omnem <placeName ref="l830">Anglię</placeName> statum vel verius conflictationes <persName ref="p506">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Butlero</persName> Anglo apud vos commoranti adscripsimus, ut is <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tue magnificentie ac aliis optimis quibusque viris super eventu <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglicarum</placeName> tumultuationum sollicitis magis commodam quam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>expetendam serenissime <placeName ref="l830">Anglie</placeName> regis adversum rebelles et <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tumultuatores victoriam significet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Medio quoque tempore <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>accepimus et alteros illos impia confęderatione pro veteri superstitione <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>revocanda coniuratos dignas sacrilegę rebellionis pęnas <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>dedisse, nempe ad tria milia in pręlio cęsa, reliquam multitudinem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>effuse fugientem non pertinatius neque longius impetitam esse, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>concitatores vero et ignarę plebis seductores magna ultione et conquisitione <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad supplicia extrahi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">In <placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> tanta omnium rerum penuria <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>est et tanta <placeName ref="l832">Gallici</placeName> militis libido et cupido in eos, quos <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tueri debebant, ut <placeName ref="l2524">Scotię</placeName> populus plus commiserationis et <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>integritatis ab hostibus <placeName ref="l830">Anglis</placeName> quam <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName> sociis se exoraturum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>confidat adeoque <placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName> adventum magis expetat quam reformidet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>De <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName> conatibus ad <placeName ref="l2122">Bulloniam</placeName> cum nihil certi ab amicis <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>acceperim, vos utpote <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName> consociatos et coniunctos et eius <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>belli consortes rogatos velim, ut me certiorem facere velitis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Qui <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tamen inter tam dissimiles persuasiones et in religione studia, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>immo contra vos pręiuditia et vobiscum in religione sentientes <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sancita supplicia constans probitatis et fidei, quę in omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>humanis actionibus fundamentum est, existimatio esse possit, non video.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Ego omnia mea offitia magnificentię tuę defero; ut meo nomine salutes <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName ref="p506">Butlerum</persName> et <persName ref="p1428">Christophorum Alesium</persName> <placeName ref="l830">Anglos</placeName> modo apud vos agentes, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>rogo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Optime valeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName>, 27. septembris anno 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/><persName ref="p8121">Christophorus Mont</persName>.</s>
				</p>
